{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0313f9e101e4c5983f0d97987aac597c5f5c24fd4083218765a28e16d5e63ec7", "ja": "（とある休日。仕事の参考に、瑞希と映えスポットを\n巡ることになった。待ち合わせ場所には既に……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。为了给工作寻找参考，和瑞希一起去逛了些适合拍照的景点。到了约定地点，却发现已经……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "6704988aee57ace699345c1bf5c1c24abec10cd8bd0a1d223b9016a505573e9e", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようございます。\nお休みの日に、付き合っていただいてすみません。", "zh": "{$P$}，早上好。\n休息日还麻烦你陪我，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b14f45d8c851f18854696e1a621eba906dd68b6850132ba852932c7c264a6555", "ja": "おはよう、瑞希。今日は俺も勉強させてもらうよ。\n……それより待たせたか？", "zh": "早上好，瑞希。今天我也要向你学习了。\n……话说回来，让你等很久了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "c01cd840c90d7a9cef2390e1cd9cefdf6f52b38d59c6fb4fe7b31300c635cdbf", "ja": "いいえ、そんなに待っていません。\nむしろ約束の10分前に集まったのが優秀で……はっ。", "zh": "没有，并没怎么等。\n不如说能在约定时间的10分钟前集合非常优秀……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "19577666db5617c1b0abaa5a7ecea3e3cc97500b94f4d757dcc7e854a86e3c7e", "ja": "楽しみのあまり、もっと前からここに来ていたことが\nバレてしまうのでは。……恥ずかしいぞ。", "zh": "该不会被发现，我因为太期待，早早就来到这里了吧……好羞耻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6dea2ac6c2aaf4fc95d1d11ae0335beb9f0b3bf198d824d547f9981ad4efffb9", "ja": "はは、俺も楽しみで早く来ちゃったんだ。\n瑞希も、楽しみにしてたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，我也是因为太期待了，不小心提前来了。\n瑞希好像也很期待啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "8ead78ec366d6e2eb9405688a64d9ab119fd6821c9bad33c793f8334ecaa318a", "ja": "はい。この日のために、\nガイドブックを作るくらいには。……ワクワク。", "zh": "是的。为了这一天，甚至做了攻略手册。……好期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5b50ac44b8d8203f5a5c062ef638c2d972dc14411a024268efd7ffbc34589e6e", "ja": "ガイドブック！？　すごい気合いが入ってるな……。\nそれじゃ今日は、瑞希に付いて行くとしよう。", "zh": "导览手册！？干劲十足啊……\n那今天就跟着瑞希走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "94dc399ac4a3205b705e23c6afcdc02a153bf2bd6a4ca4b5675b49d5f2322571", "ja": "任せてください。まずは巨大な本のオブジェがある\n場所にご案内します。こちらです、どうぞ。", "zh": "交给我吧。首先请让我带您去有巨大书本摆件的地方。这边请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4791ce175c6c81ceaeed310d596c5a56f27ac67930eb7db57bdb3bdc7c584d52", "ja": "いやーすごい面白かったな。\n自分が小さくなった気がして、不思議な体験だったよ。", "zh": "哎呀——真是太有意思了。\n感觉自己好像变小了，真是一次奇妙的体验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "bf4496517ea88fbbb4518a8284b6bccba77e3fb09d4d6a99f7c1dd434eaedafe", "ja": "お褒めに預かり光栄です。他の作品も楽しいもの\nばかりで、時間を忘れて……あっ、時間。", "zh": "承蒙夸奖，真是我的荣幸。其他作品也都很有趣，让人忘记了时间……啊，时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "9106b8b95f7cb1029b748cf70fd965b7690253ffe80fb692bf84143d2041ce34", "ja": "{$P$}、\n大変なことが起きてしまいました。", "zh": "{$P$}，出大事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1012_p", "source_sha256": "97ef8d545c3b0fdc983d1b71b14ede475dc239d9549fee22a3a7f0e86875a6dc", "ja": "えっ、どうした！？", "zh": "诶，怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "3199b44236894a057f26cfd4d3565614443d0ff229ca0a4ed89c81fef66a1394", "ja": "本当に時間を忘れてしまっていて。\n計画より滞在時間がオーバーしています。", "zh": "真的把时间忘得一干二净了。\n逗留时间已经超过计划了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "241d6644ae635190d69e770aee2d3d0bf478a691831fbc6401aea4a226f2fc1e", "ja": "このままでは、予定していた映えスポットを\n全て巡ることができません。……大ピンチ。", "zh": "这样下去，就没法逛遍原计划中的所有出片景点了。……大危机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1015_p", "source_sha256": "85ed0e659ad73719ab456bf168ea7d12ba1130266827302e3ffe30790ae1778d", "ja": "もうすぐお昼だけど、まだ一か所目か。\nこのペースだと、そんなに見て回れないかもな……。", "zh": "马上就到中午了，才刚逛完第一个地方啊。\n按这个步调，可能逛不了多少景点了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "4ec9098399ba5a70da9abbbf10b767a8dcd4273afea9c06dcb95da07831ba118", "ja": "はい……。急げば、多くの場所にいけると思います。\nただ、ゆっくり楽しむ時間はなさそうです。", "zh": "是的……如果抓紧一点，我想应该能去很多地方。只是，恐怕没有时间慢慢享受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d3da217dacb923bbc118db945dce4c7685f8116e257bb34f6f917ef5527e408e", "ja": "……でも、今日のためにたくさん調べたんだろう？\nそれなら、楽しまないのはもったいない。", "zh": "……不过，你为了今天，应该查了很多资料吧？\n既然这样，不好好享受一番就太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b8bccdc3b4987663990a3f077db41b1b14eb16ede13cbf961d6fe117acd8b16b", "ja": "瑞希のガイドブックを見てたら、他の場所も、気に\nなってね。今日行けなかった場所は、別の日にしよう。", "zh": "看着瑞希的指南书，就也开始在意其他地方了。今天没能去的地方，就改天再去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "48a6f8c7c8701908bf6d0eb5897dc81eade95da1a006322fb6a314016290edf3", "ja": "……いいんですか、{$P$}？", "zh": "……这样真的可以吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3839b3d13708bafe5a2c9adc7f525668fe03f3f1cecbc2e16aa87519a6eab49a", "ja": "もちろん。何が人気か、勉強になるし。\nガイドブックの場所を全部制覇するまで付き合うよ。", "zh": "当然。这样也能学习到哪些地方受欢迎。\n我会陪你把攻略书上的地方全部打卡完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "be2baec8f30a24fd001453135a008d482076ca22d87a2200bb82a1f3dfc1569b", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\nそれではぜひ、お願いします。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。那么，就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0524_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "099fa741959290e3aa3fb9d599dcbf1fca0b45f999a902e6652a71ab05d2746e", "ja": "{$P$}と一緒なら、人気スポットも\nなぜかもっと輝いてみえます。……きゅん。", "zh": "要是和{$P$}在一起，不知为何，\n就连热门景点也显得格外耀眼了。……心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
